{{About|custom mannequin {{ll|scripts}}|mannequin objects|mannequin}}
<translate>

<!--T:1-->
[[File:mannequin - mapping guide.png|thumb]]

<!--T:2-->
Used to define {{ll|Mannequin|mannequins}}, which can be used in {{ll|Mapping|mapping}} to create mannequins in the world.

<!--T:3-->
To get a list of available mannequins, see {{ll|Mannequin_(scripts)#Available_mannequins|this}}.

== Parameters == <!--T:4-->

<!--T:5-->
You can find a full list of the parameters in the [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/scripts/mannequin.html ScriptsDocs].
</translate>

{{Note|Animal models and textures can be used in mannequins ! For the {{ll|outfit}} parameter, you can use the {{Code|Naked}} outfit but some clothing items can be used by animals such as hats.}}

<translate>
